  "summary": "You can measure the flexural strength of your dental composite bars using a universal mechanical testing system. The Instron 5967 is perfectly suited for this destructive testing method. You will just need to confirm that the lab has a suitable 3-point or 4-point bending fixture and an appropriately sized load cell available for your specific sample dimensions."
}

{
  "measurement_needs": [
