      "instrument_id": "EQ21",
      "role": "primary",
      "technique": "Rheology",
      "why": "This is another hybrid rheometer capable of measuring the stiffness of soft gels. It has an environmental test chamber, though you will need to ensure the sample does not dehydrate.",
